**Route**

V priečinku `routes` budeme definovať naše route.
```javascript
// sp4InfoRoutes.js
const express = require('express');
const router = express.Router();
const Sp4InfoController = require('../controllers/Sp4InfoController');

router.get('/', Sp4InfoController.getAll);
router.post('/', Sp4InfoController.create);

module.exports = router;
```
